{"schema":2,"commit":"4901b7e32fffb2c3679ecfd609f521497951fb15","branch":"i18n-task1-core","base_sha":"74821c04365a04050a1ce99e491df177ef1d9575","message":"Localise core messages (German/English)\n\nAdd an i18n module to girocrab-core. German stays the source language and\ndefault; the exported set_language(code:) switches the process to English for\nany en* BCP-47 tag. User-facing strings are written in German at the call site\nand routed through tr() (static) or trf() (templates with {0}, {1}\nplaceholders); English lives in one match table. Tests use tr_in() or a\nthread-local with_language() override and never touch the global language,\nso German-asserting tests stay deterministic. A test scans the sources and\nfails if any tr/trf literal lacks an English entry.\n\nTranslated: CoreError Display, bank descriptors, transfer validation, FinTS\nchallenges and HKCCS return codes, comdirect/Trade Republic/Enable Banking\nchallenges and errors, demo connector, portal/MoneyMoney import errors,\ndocuments, amount parsing, the settings catalogue, payment method and asset\nclass labels.\n\nBuilt-in account group and starter category names stay stored in German\n(groups are found by name, flow classification matches top-level category\nnames) and are translated on read in list_account_groups, list_categories\nand list_transactions. Saving an unchanged translated name keeps the German\ndefault. SettingEntry gains group_title; group stays the stable German id.","coding_time_nanos":1430059916000,"totals":{"added_lines":996,"ai_added_lines":390,"human_added_lines":606,"deleted_lines":172,"ai_deleted_lines":19,"human_deleted_lines":153,"files":19,"tokens":{"input":4,"output":2490,"cache_read":516451,"cache_write":5672},"models":{"claude-opus-5-5":390}},"by_tool":{"claude":{"lines":390,"deleted_lines":19,"suggested_lines":367,"accepted_lines":390,"tokens":{"input":4,"output":2490,"cache_read":516451,"cache_write":5672}}},"by_gen_type":{"chat":0,"cli":409,"completion":0,"human":7